<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS    TERM	AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.849  bln	 14 days   25.98 pct</p>
<p>    1.849  bln	 12 days   25.87 pct</p>
<p>    1.850  bln	 10 days   25.84 pct</p>
<p>    1.000  bln	  3 days   25.33 pct</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
